+/*
+ * Forced first include for the Linux host-check build.
+ *
+ * Copyright 2026 elfuse contributors
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+ *
+ * glibc defines si_code, si_status and friends as macros that expand into the
+ * _sifields union. elfuse sources use those spellings as ordinary identifiers,
+ * which is fine against the macOS SDK and breaks against glibc, so the macros
+ * are dropped here before any elfuse header is seen. The remaining defines are
+ * Darwin-only constants that the compiled translation units reference on paths
+ * no host check executes.
+ */
